#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support Ditana development through Liberapay, Buy Me a Coffee, GitHub Sponsors, or Patreon."
msgstr "Apoye el desarrollo de Ditana a través de Liberapay, Buy Me a Coffee, GitHub Sponsors o Patreon."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Donate"
msgstr "Donar"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"Ditana is the result of years of work, built on the conviction that a Linux "
"distribution should explain its choices rather than hide them. It is "
"completely free and open source, and its continued development relies on "
"community support."
msgstr ""
"Ditana es el resultado de años de trabajo, basado en la convicción de que "
"una distribución de Linux debe explicar sus decisiones en lugar de "
"ocultarlas. Es completamente libre y de código abierto, y la continuidad de "
"su desarrollo depende del apoyo de la comunidad."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"By donating, you enable me to keep enhancing Ditana — exploring new "
"features, responding to user feedback, and maintaining the level of detail "
"this project aims for. Every contribution makes a difference."
msgstr ""
"Con su donación, me permite seguir mejorando Ditana: explorar nuevas "
"funciones, responder a los comentarios de los usuarios y mantener el nivel "
"de detalle al que aspira este proyecto. Cada contribución marca la "
"diferencia."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where donations go"
msgstr "Adónde van las donaciones"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"Donations are processed through **acrion innovations GmbH**, a Swiss company "
"I founded to manage the financial side of my projects. While the company "
"provides the legal and financial framework, **acrion** represents my work as "
"a solo developer. Your support directly funds Ditana's ongoing development, "
"server infrastructure, and the time required to keep up with Arch's rolling "
"release."
msgstr ""
"Las donaciones se gestionan a través de **acrion innovations GmbH**, una "
"empresa suiza que fundé para administrar la parte financiera de mis "
"proyectos. Aunque la empresa aporta el marco legal y financiero, **acrion** "
"representa mi trabajo como desarrollador independiente. Su apoyo financia "
"directamente el desarrollo continuo de Ditana, la infraestructura de "
"servidores y el tiempo necesario para seguir el ritmo de la actualización "
"continua de Arch."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to support Ditana"
msgstr "Cómo apoyar a Ditana"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**Liberapay**](https://liberapay.com/acrion/donate) — recurring donations, "
"no platform fee."
msgstr ""
"[**Liberapay**](https://liberapay.com/acrion/donate): donaciones periódicas, "
"sin comisión de la plataforma."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**Buy Me a Coffee**](https://buymeacoffee.com/acrion) — one-off support."
msgstr "[**Buy Me a Coffee**](https://buymeacoffee.com/acrion): apoyo puntual."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**GitHub Sponsors**](https://github.com/sponsors/acrion) — if you already "
"donate to other open-source work via GitHub."
msgstr ""
"[**GitHub Sponsors**](https://github.com/sponsors/acrion): si ya dona a "
"otros proyectos de código abierto a través de GitHub."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "[**Patreon**](https://patreon.com/acriondev) — tiered support."
msgstr "[**Patreon**](https://patreon.com/acriondev): apoyo por niveles."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "Thank you for helping keep Ditana alive, growing, and uncompromising."
msgstr ""
"Gracias por ayudar a que Ditana siga viva, creciendo y sin concesiones."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "— Stefan"
msgstr "—Stefan"
